      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ROCK IT KATHY (1) has been beaten for early speed lately, last time finishing fourth (25.97) in a Grade 5 at Ballarat. Solid record at the distance winning three races. Hard to knock her form from this box, unbeaten in two starts. Can atone. TRACKING ME (2) hasn't been far away, finishing in the money two back at this track then finished on the winners' heels in a Grade 5 FIN at this track last time. Can feature with the right run. KODA (5) won comfortably last time scoring by 5 lengths at The Meadows after jumping from box 1 (30.36). Will need some luck early after drawing a tricky box here. Consistent performer from this draw with a win and two minor placings to his credit. Makes plenty of appeal on the back of that last-start win. POPPER (8) should be thereabouts after filling a top-three spot most recently.",
